\title "12. Play and loop"
\ts (4 4)
5.3.4{txt "1. Press Space: it plays from the start and the line follows. Press Space again to stop."}
  7.3.4 5.3.4 7.3.4 |
8.2.4{txt "2. Press this 8, then the Shift+Right arrow key seven times: bars 2 and 3 are selected. 3. Press L: a red bracket under the two bars marks the loop. 4. Press Space: the two bars play over and over. Space stops; L again takes the loop away."}
  7.2.4 5.2.4 7.2.4 |
5.3.4 7.3.4 5.3.4 7.3.4 | 0.3.1 |

